    "short_description": "Exploding Babies is an absurd and chaotic shared screen arena blaster/party game for up to four simultaneous players. Enter a post-apocalyptic world where human babies are pitted against each other as part of a slowly unraveling intergalactic conspiracy to breed alien superchildren.",
